{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/swift\/discardingtaskgroup\/cancelall()"]}],"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"metadata":{"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"cancelAll","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"()","kind":"text"}],"modules":[{"relatedModules":[],"name":"Swift"}],"externalID":"s:12_Concurrency19DiscardingTaskGroupV9cancelAllyyF","platforms":[{"introducedAt":"8.0","deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"beta":false,"name":"iOS"},{"introducedAt":"8.0","deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"beta":false,"name":"iPadOS"},{"unavailable":false,"deprecated":false,"beta":false,"name":"Mac Catalyst","introducedAt":"13.0"},{"introducedAt":"10.10","deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"beta":false,"name":"macOS"},{"introducedAt":"9.0","deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"beta":false,"name":"tvOS"},{"introducedAt":"1.0","deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"beta":false,"name":"visionOS"},{"introducedAt":"2.0","deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"beta":false,"name":"watchOS"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Method","title":"cancelAll()","symbolKind":"method","role":"symbol"},"sections":[],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/DiscardingTaskGroup\/cancelAll()","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift","doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/DiscardingTaskGroup"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Cancel all of the remaining tasks in the group."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"cancelAll"},{"kind":"text","text":"()"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"If you add a task to a group after canceling the group,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"that task is canceled immediately after being added to the group.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Immediately canceled child tasks should therefore cooperatively check for and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"react  to cancellation, e.g. by throwing an ","type":"text"},{"code":"CancellationError","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" at their","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"earliest convenience, or otherwise handling the cancellation.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"There are no restrictions on where you can call this method.","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Code inside a child task or even another task can cancel a group,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"however one should be very careful to not keep a reference to the"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"group longer than the "},{"code":"with...TaskGroup(...) { ... }","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" method body is executing."}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Task.isCancelled"}]}],"type":"aside","name":"See Also","style":"note"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":""},{"code":"DiscardingTaskGroup.isCancelled","type":"codeVoice"}]}],"type":"aside","name":"See Also","style":"note"}]}],"references":{"doc://com.apple.Swift/documentation/Swift":{"title":"Swift","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Build apps using a powerful open language."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift","role":"collection","url":"\/documentation\/swift","kind":"symbol"},"doc://com.apple.Swift/documentation/Swift/DiscardingTaskGroup/cancelAll()":{"url":"\/documentation\/swift\/discardingtaskgroup\/cancelall()","title":"cancelAll()","kind":"sy